OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FEarly morning sunny spells
OL,6,Ffading as skies turn mainly cloudy.
OL,7,FThe odd shower is possible, but many
OL,8,Fplaces probably staying dry. Breezy
OL,9,Fbut rather warm for October.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,12,Fmoving southwards on Saturday. Drier
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday then damp
OL,14,Fat times on Monday. Breezy at times
OL,15,Fbut staying rather warm for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
